  "description": "In elementary school, Ban Hana was always the tallest in her class.\nBut while everyone else kept growing… she didn’t.\nNow in high school, Hana finds herself face-to-face with a tall, broad-shouldered boy she barely recognizes — so tall she has to crane her neck just to meet his eyes.\nAnd that boy?\nIt’s Han Gyeol — the same kid who used to be shorter than her.\nThe height difference hasn’t changed.\nIt’s still 35 centimeters.\nBut this time, everything else has.\nA story about a 35-centimeter gap — and how their positions completely flipped.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=703847), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=3357816)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://manga.line.me/product/periodic?id=Z0003146)",
